 ],
 "notes": "Region default (\"us-east-1\") not checked: a provider-block region literal is not observable in the normalised plan (2 of 3 real candidates do this). policy_s3_all binds s3:* and the account principal to one statement in an aws_iam_policy_document; for a literal policy string it requires both in the same policy (principal given literally or through a variable). policy_bucket_and_objects only tests the object ARN (/*): the bucket ARN alone has too many spellings to match. The bucket name being built from the base-name variable is not checked (the planned name is unknown and the declared text is often in a local)."
